WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:06.410
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie, hopefully you’ve
all had a chance to see both the Flash and

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:07.410
Arrow this week.

00:00:07.410 --> 00:00:08.670
This will be a combined Q&amp;A.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:13.400
I think I’ll just call it Arrow vs Flash
every week.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.959
This will be a regular thursday Q&amp;A unless
something crazy happens with the schedule.

00:00:15.959 --> 00:00:20.440
In case you’re new to either show and you
haven’t read the comics before, no you don’t

00:00:20.440 --> 00:00:22.300
absolutely have to watch both shows to understand
what’s going on.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:34.329
But they share a narrative, so it will be
a lot more fun if you do watch them both.

00:00:34.329 --> 00:00:42.370
Let’s get to some questions, careful for
spoilers from both the episodes if you haven’t

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:43.370
seen them yet.

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.350
I’ll wait just a sec...okay, here we go.

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:51.320
